      ],
      "Notes": "\"Chain Reaction!\" A 8+ pip damage spell on him while Hisamoto stands: Smoke Screen, then Hisamoto's Rebirth, then Kensaburo's Power Nova. New blocks: these allies, an ally casts. \"A {pips} pip\" is read as {pips} or more (a guess)." },

    { "When": "PlayerCasts", "Category": "Damage", "OnBoss": true, "CostMin": 8, "AlliesUp": ["589303"], "AlliesDown": ["589299"],
