      "Notes": "\"The Chain Continues!\" The same once Hisamoto is down but Kensaburo stands: Storm Lord, then Kensaburo's Minor Blessing on each ally. New blocks: these allies, an ally casts." },

    { "When": "PlayerCasts", "Category": "Damage", "OnBoss": true, "CostMin": 8, "AlliesDown": ["589299", "589303"],
